I’d probably report both. Since the stepwiseqtl output gives one QTL, I’d maybe instead look at the output of addoneqtl(); that is, the genome scan controlling for the major QTL. You’re trying to describe what loci seem to be contributing to the trait, and the strength of evidence for them. And their pattern of effect (plots of phenotype averages vs QTL genotype).

karl

