Dear Karl,
thanks to your help I succeded in important my data into R/QTL (see below)
Thanks a lot and have a very good week end.
Bye
Isacco

---
 --Read the following data:
	 100  individuals
	 19  markers
	 1  phenotypes
 --Cross type: f2

